# Coastal Ways Plumbing — repo hygiene
# This repo publishes straight to GitHub Pages, so anything committed becomes a
# public URL. Keep build junk and customer documents out of it.

# macOS
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Film-verify / screenshot artefacts (regenerated on demand, never served)
*.preview.desktop.png
*.preview.mobile.png

# Issued customer documents — real addresses. These belong in Drive, not on a
# public website. PDFs cannot carry a noindex tag.
tools/compliance-cert/issued/*.pdf

# Beau's signature image — publishing it puts a liftable copy on the internet.
tools/compliance-cert/beau-petterson-signature.png
